"A sum of fewer tags where one of more is expected: FX-26's width
 subtyping; to Rust, two enums (C22)."
(define-effect kfx (maxeff (read @globals) spin))
(define-type shape (sumof (circle i64) (rect (productof (w i64) (h i64)))))
(define one (sumof (circle i64)) (sum circle 1))
(define s shape one)
